---
layout: base.liquid
titleKey: titleHome
---

{%- comment -%}
  src/index.liquid — Stage 5. The envelope: a full-height split seam with a
  seal pinned to its centre, per .claude/stages/5-home-envelope.md.

  No <main> wrapper here — base.liquid already supplies it, and its guard
  keeps header/footer off "/" so the envelope is the entire page (§4.7.1,
  §4.7.2). The seal MUST stay a plain <a href="/rsvp/"> so it navigates with
  JavaScript off; public/assets/js/envelope.js only ever intercepts the click
  to play the animation first.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign theme = themes[site.partyTheme] -%}
<div class="envelope">
  <div class="envelope-half envelope-half--top">
    <p class="envelope-eyebrow">{{ theme.eyebrow }}</p>
    <h1 class="envelope-headline">{{ theme.headline }}</h1>
  </div>

  <a class="seal" href="/rsvp/">
    <span class="seal-label">{{ theme.sealLabel }}</span>
  </a>

  <div class="envelope-half envelope-half--bottom">
    <p class="envelope-subheadline">{{ theme.subheadline }}</p>
    <p class="envelope-tagline">{{ theme.tagline }}</p>
  </div>
</div>
